1
00:00:00,000 --> 00:00:02,680
One, two, three, four.

2
00:00:02,680 --> 00:00:04,420
That's a bar.

3
00:00:04,420 --> 00:00:06,020
What goes in it?

4
00:00:06,020 --> 00:00:08,060
Let's find out.

5
00:00:08,060 --> 00:00:11,880
Pip rings the bell and lets it go,

6
00:00:11,880 --> 00:00:15,640
it hums the whole way through, so slow.

7
00:00:16,000 --> 00:00:17,820
One, two, three, four,

8
00:00:17,820 --> 00:00:20,240
and then it's done.

9
00:00:20,240 --> 00:00:22,100
Fill the bar, fill the bar,

10
00:00:22,100 --> 00:00:24,040
four beats long from end to end.

11
00:00:24,040 --> 00:00:25,980
Long notes, short notes, quiet rests,

12
00:00:25,980 --> 00:00:27,700
every bar is one whole, friend.

13
00:00:27,700 --> 00:00:30,040
Fill the bar, fill the bar,

14
00:00:30,040 --> 00:00:31,740
make it full and make it ring.

15
00:00:31,740 --> 00:00:33,780
When there's no more room to fill,

16
00:00:33,780 --> 00:00:36,220
that's the moment that we sing!

17
00:00:36,220 --> 00:00:37,840
Dot taps once and holds it, two,

18
00:00:37,840 --> 00:00:39,800
then taps again and holds it too.

19
00:00:39,800 --> 00:00:42,040
Half a bar, then half a bar:

20
00:00:42,040 --> 00:00:43,960
two halves make one whole. There you are.

21
00:00:43,960 --> 00:00:46,360
The mending crew begin to hammer,

22
00:00:46,360 --> 00:00:48,480
they never stop and never stammer.

23
00:00:48,480 --> 00:00:50,860
Tap, tap, tap, tap.

24
00:00:50,860 --> 00:00:51,700
Tap, tap, tap, tap.

25
00:00:51,700 --> 00:00:53,880
One beat each, and four in all:

26
00:00:53,880 --> 00:00:55,840
four quarters fill it, wall to wall.

27
00:00:55,840 --> 00:00:57,840
Fill the bar, fill the bar,

28
00:00:57,840 --> 00:00:59,820
four beats long from end to end.

29
00:00:59,820 --> 00:01:01,760
Long notes, short notes, quiet rests,

30
00:01:01,760 --> 00:01:03,720
every bar is one whole, friend.

31
00:01:03,720 --> 00:01:05,880
Fill the bar, fill the bar,

32
00:01:05,880 --> 00:01:07,760
make it full and make it ring.

33
00:01:07,760 --> 00:01:09,720
When there's no more room to fill,

34
00:01:09,720 --> 00:01:12,640
that's the moment that we sing!

35
00:01:12,640 --> 00:01:13,820
Bramble's magpie hops in fast,

36
00:01:13,820 --> 00:01:15,760
two little hops in every beat.

37
00:01:15,760 --> 00:01:17,780
Eight quick eighths, and not one more,

38
00:01:17,780 --> 00:01:19,800
and the bar is full and neat.

39
00:01:19,800 --> 00:01:22,240
Shh. A rest is quiet, but a rest still counts.

40
00:01:22,240 --> 00:01:23,980
It takes up room, the same amount.

41
00:01:24,160 --> 00:01:26,140
A quarter rest, a beat of air,

42
00:01:26,140 --> 00:01:28,380
the bar keeps time while nothing's there.

43
00:01:28,380 --> 00:01:30,100
Tap, tap, tap.

44
00:01:30,100 --> 00:01:31,980
Tap, tap, tap.

45
00:01:31,980 --> 00:01:34,400
Now a half, and then a quarter,

46
00:01:34,400 --> 00:01:36,280
then two eighths to fill the last.

47
00:01:36,280 --> 00:01:38,380
Long, then shorter, then the shortest:

48
00:01:38,380 --> 00:01:39,920
one whole bar, from slow to fast.

49
00:01:39,920 --> 00:01:42,080
Fill the bar, fill the bar,

50
00:01:42,080 --> 00:01:43,820
four beats long from end to end.

51
00:01:43,820 --> 00:01:45,780
Long notes, short notes, quiet rests,

52
00:01:45,780 --> 00:01:47,760
every bar is one whole, friend.

53
00:01:47,760 --> 00:01:49,840
Fill the bar, fill the bar,

54
00:01:49,840 --> 00:01:51,720
make it full and make it ring.

55
00:01:51,720 --> 00:01:53,720
When there's no more room to fill,

56
00:01:53,720 --> 00:01:55,860
that's the moment that we sing!

57
00:01:55,860 --> 00:01:57,720
Your turn.

58
00:01:57,720 --> 00:01:59,980
Fill a bar!
